        "page": 1,
        "section": "executive_summary",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s1"
      },
      "text": "On December 10, a new variant of the Disttrack malware was submitted to VirusTotal (SHA256:c3ab58b3154e5f5101ba74fccfd27a9ab445e41262cdf47e8cc3be7416a5904f) that shares a considerable amount of code with the Disttrack malware used in the Shamoon 2 attacks in 2016 and 2017 that we previously published here, here, and here.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_3",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "PaloAlto_Shamoon3-Targets-Oil-and-Gas(12-13-2018)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "executive_summary",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s3"
      },
      "text": "In previous attacks, we were able to determine the impacted organization based on the domain names and credentials used by the Disttrack tool to spread to other systems on the network.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_6",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "PaloAlto_Shamoon3-Targets-Oil-and-Gas(12-13-2018)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "executive_summary",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s6"
      },
      "text": "According to a press release, Saipem confirmed that they experienced a cyberattack that involved a variant of the Shamoon malware.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_7",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "PaloAlto_Shamoon3-Targets-Oil-and-Gas(12-13-2018)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "executive_summary",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s7"
      },
      "text": "Saipem told Reuters that 300 systems on their network were crippled by the malware related to the 2012 Shamoon attacks.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_14",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "PaloAlto_Shamoon3-Targets-Oil-and-Gas(12-13-2018)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "executive_summary",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s14"
      },
      "text": "Before accessing the ciphertext, the dropper subtracts 14 from the specified offset, which is the same as previous Disttrack samples delivered in Shamoon 2 attacks.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
