      },
      "text": "SHA256 of Cleartext Resource name LNG Description Wiper module Offset 7892-14 Length 402432 SHA256 of Cleartext The dropper will install itself to the system (and remote systems if spreading was possible) by creating a service with the attributes listed in Table 4 below.",
      "language": "en",
